    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this game: </h2>I'm at school but, since I have the attention span of a goldfish, I cannot help it, I have to use my phone! <br><br><strong>Welcome to Phones not allowed!</strong> <br>A Clicker/Survival hybrid game that will allow you to collect and interact with awesome anime artworks in a very sneaky way! <br><br><br><br><i>- Interact with super cute anime artworks, add likes and comments just like you would do in a real social media!<br><br>- Avoid dangers like your classmates harassing you, be mindful of quick time events and your surroundings!<br><br>- We watchful of your teacher! She will always be on the lookout, if you get caught you will get suspended!<br><br>- Unlock unique abilities that will help you stay undetected!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2>- 30 original Anime artworks to collect<br>- Multiple characters to interact with (teacher, classmates, janitor and school assistant<br>- Be careful of sounds! They will provide precious hints and warns you about dangers<br>- A unique progression system featuring unique abilities",
